messages.content:
After three tests, 4 possibilities remain, all "needs one":
- {gavozir, basugek}
- {gavozir, davanir}
- {gavozir, pagedu}
- {basugek, davanir}

No "needs two" pair is left. Under "needs two", the third test would mean the nexioms are gavozir and davanir. But then the first test, which had gavozir without davanir, would have stayed dark.

Testing basugek alone splits these evenly:
- **Lights (2):** {gavozir, basugek} or {basugek, davanir}. Then testing gavozir alone would settle it.
- **Stays dark (2):** {gavozir, davanir} or {gavozir, pagedu}. Then testing davanir alone would settle it.

TEST: basugek
